1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,478
Nelayan Belitung cari teripang...

2
00:00:02,478 --> 00:00:05,225
malah menemukan harta karun Dinasti Tang!

3
00:00:05,225 --> 00:00:06,713
60.000 benda,

4
00:00:06,713 --> 00:00:09,600
dalam kapal Arab 1.200 tahun!

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,668
Kapalnya dijahit sabut kelapa,

6
00:00:11,668 --> 00:00:13,217
tanpa satu paku pun.

7
00:00:13,217 --> 00:00:16,943
Ada cangkir emas Dinasti Tang
terbesar yang pernah ditemukan.

8
00:00:16,943 --> 00:00:19,314
Tapi koleksinya dijual...

9
00:00:19,314 --> 00:00:20,420
ke Singapura,

10
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,398
32 juta dolar.

11
00:00:22,398 --> 00:00:23,337
Di sana,

12
00:00:23,337 --> 00:00:25,195
namanya bukan lagi Belitung.

13
00:00:25,195 --> 00:00:26,773
Harus pulang ke Indonesia,

14
00:00:26,773 --> 00:00:28,372
atau tetap di Singapura?

15
00:00:28,372 --> 00:00:29,911
Tulis di komentar!
